# fixture: equivalent_class_added_before.ttl
# Purpose: baseline for an equivalent-class assertion. ex:A and ex:B are two
# independent classes. Pairs with equivalent_class_added_after.ttl, which adds
# ex:A owl:equivalentClass ex:B. A new equivalence is information, not a
# constraint on existing data, so equivalent_class_added is non_breaking.

@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

ex:A a owl:Class .
ex:B a owl:Class .
